為軍諮祭酒，出為甯遠將軍、荊州刺史、領護南蠻校尉、假節。始到州，而建平流人傅密等叛迎蜀賊杜弢，顗狼狽失據。陶侃遣將吳寄以兵救之，故顗得免，因奔王敦于豫章。敦留之。軍司戴邈曰：「顗雖退敗，未有蒞眾之咎，德望素重，宜還復之。」敦不從。帝召為揚威將軍、兗州刺史。顗還建康，帝留顗不遣，復以為軍諮祭酒，尋轉右長史。中興建，補吏部尚書。頃之，以醉酒為有司所糾，白衣領職。復坐門生斫傷人，免官。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-069-zhouyi:p002:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"元帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-zhouyi:p002:m0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"傅密","kind":"person","person_id":"2ek_879_zfk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-zhouyi:p002:m0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"杜弢","kind":"person","person_id":"7dv_udy_955","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-zhouyi:p002:m0055","start":55,"end":56,"surface":"顗","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-zhouyi:p002:m0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"陶侃","kind":"person","person_id":"twd_erg_kmz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-zhouyi:p002:m0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"吳寄","kind":"person","person_id":"ns4_a8h_396","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-zhouyi:p002:m0070","start":70,"end":71,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-zhouyi:p002:m0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"顗","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-zhouyi:p002:m0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"王敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-zhouyi:p002:m0085","start":85,"end":86,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-zhouyi:p002:m0087","start":87,"end":88,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"3xx_gdy_or6_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-069-zhouyi:p002:m0091","start":91,"end